c comment line begin with c
c theres exactly one header in the format `p edge {n} {m}` where n is the number of nodes and m the number of edges
p edge 5 4
c there are exact m edge lines of format `e {u} {v}`
e 1 2
e 2 3
e 3 4
e 4 5
c there are up to n color lines in the format `v {u} {c}` indicating that node {u} has color {c}
n 1 3
c empty lines may appear:
